</span><span begin="01:12.842" end="01:13.370">な</span><span begin="01:13.370" end="01:13.899">い</span><span begin="01:13.899" end="01:15.418">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">都幻想成为少年漫画的主角难道就不喜欢自己吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yumemite bakka jibun ga suki janai no</span></p><p begin="01:16.039" end="01:22.062" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:16.039" end="01:17.081">何</span><span begin="01:17.081" end="01:18.124">が</span><span begin="01:18.124" end="01:18.602">欲</span><span begin="01:18.602" end="01:19.080">し</span><span begin="01:19.080" end="01:19.558">い</span><span begin="01:19.558" end="01:20.037">か</span><span begin="01:20.037" end="01:20.279">分</span><span begin="01:20.279" end="01:20.521">か</span><span begin="01:20.521" end="01:20.763">ら</span><span begin="01:20.763" end="01:21.005">な</span><span begin="01:21.005" end="01:21.248">く</span><span begin="01:21.248" end="01:22.062">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不明白自己究竟追求什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani ga hoshii ka wakaranakute</span></p><p begin="01:22.092" end="01:32.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:22.092" end="01:22.336">た</span><span begin="01:22.336" end="01:22.580">だ</span><span begin="01:22.580" end="01:22.824">欲</span><span begin="01:22.824" end="01:23.068">し</span><span begin="01:23.068" end="01:23.312">が</span><span begin="01:23.312" end="01:23.557">っ</span><span begin="01:23.557" end="01:24.323">て </span><span begin="01:24.729" end="01:25.270">ぬ</span><span begin="01:25.270" end="01:25.811">る</span><span begin="01:25.811" end="01:26.353">い</span><span begin="01:26.353" end="01:27.711">涙</span><span begin="01:27.711" end="01:28.558">が</span><span begin="01:28.558" end="01:29.236">頬</span><span begin="01:29.236" end="01:29.915">を</span><span begin="01:29.915" end="01:31.385">伝</span><span begin="01:31.385" end="01:32.855">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仅仅只是渴望着温热的泪水自脸上滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tada hoshigatte nurui namida ga hoo wo tsutau</span></p><p begin="01:32.885" end="01:34.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:32.885" end="01:33.025">言</span><span begin="01:33.025" end="01:33.165">い</span><span begin="01:33.165" end="01:33.305">た</span><span begin="01:33.305" end="01:33.445">い</span><span begin="01:33.445" end="01:33.585">こ</span><span begin="01:33.585" end="01:33.726">と</span><span begin="01:33.726" end="01:33.896">な</span><span begin="01:33.896" end="01:34.066">ん</span><span begin="01:34.066" end="01:34.237">か</span><span begin="01:34.237" end="01:34.576">無</span><span begin="01:34.576" end="01:34.914">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没什么话想说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iitai koto nanka nai</span></p><p begin="01:34.945" end="01:38.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:34.945" end="01:35.146">た</span><span begin="01:35.146" end="01:35.347">だ</span><span begin="01:35.347" end="01:35.548">も</span><span begin="01:35.548" end="01:35.749">う</span><span begin="01:35.749" end="01:35.950">一</span><span begin="01:35.950" end="01:36.153">度</span><span begin="01:36.153" end="01:36.614">会</span><span begin="01:36.614" end="01:37.073">い</span><span begin="01:37.073" end="01:37.532">た</span><span begin="01:37.532" end="01:38.825">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是想要再见你一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tada mouichido aitai</span></p><p begin="01:41.197" end="01:43.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:41.197" end="01:41.331">言</span><span begin="01:41.331" end="01:41.465">い</span><span begin="01:41.465" end="01:41.599">た</span><span begin="01:41.599" end="01:41.733">い</span><span begin="01:41.733" end="01:41.867">こ</span><span begin="01:41.867" end="01:42.001">と</span><span begin="01:42.001" end="01:42.244">言</span><span begin="01:42.244" end="01:42.488">え</span><span begin="01:42.488" end="01:42.869">な</span><span begin="01:42.869" end="01:43.250">い</span>