.503">ん</span><span begin="02:32.503" end="02:33.085">な</span><span begin="02:33.085" end="02:33.560">こ</span><span begin="02:33.560" end="02:34.034">と</span><span begin="02:34.034" end="02:34.508">で</span><span begin="02:34.508" end="02:34.984">も</span><span begin="02:34.984" end="02:35.279">や</span><span begin="02:35.279" end="02:35.573">っ</span><span begin="02:35.573" end="02:35.867">て</span><span begin="02:35.867" end="02:36.163">み</span><span begin="02:36.163" end="02:37.231">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管去多方尝试吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">donna koto demo yattemite</span></p><p begin="02:37.261" end="02:47.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:37.261" end="02:37.523">損</span><span begin="02:37.523" end="02:37.785">を</span><span begin="02:37.785" end="02:38.047">し</span><span begin="02:38.047" end="02:38.309">た</span><span begin="02:38.309" end="02:38.573">っ</span><span begin="02:38.573" end="02:39.331">て </span><span begin="02:39.887" end="02:40.645">少</span><span begin="02:40.645" end="02:41.404">し</span><span begin="02:41.404" end="02:42.605">経</span><span begin="02:42.605" end="02:43.806">験</span><span begin="02:43.806" end="02:45.008">値</span><span begin="02:45.008" end="02:45.678">上</span><span begin="02:45.678" end="02:46.348">が</span><span begin="02:46.348" end="02:47.928">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算失败受挫也会稍微学到经验</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">son wo shitatte sukoshi keikenchi agaru</span></p><p begin="02:47.958" end="02:50.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:47.958" end="02:48.120">新</span><span begin="02:48.120" end="02:48.282">聞</span><span begin="02:48.282" end="02:48.444">な</span><span begin="02:48.444" end="02:48.606">ん</span><span begin="02:48.606" end="02:48.768">か</span><span begin="02:48.768" end="02:49.077">い</span><span begin="02:49.077" end="02:49.386">ら</span><span begin="02:49.386" end="02:49.695">な</span><span begin="02:49.695" end="02:50.004">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">报纸就不必了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinbun nanka iranai</span></p><p begin="02:50.035" end="02:52.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:50.035" end="02:50.226">肝</span><span begin="02:50.226" end="02:50.417">心</span><span begin="02:50.417" end="02:50.608">な</span><span begin="02:50.608" end="02:50.799">こ</span><span begin="02:50.799" end="02:50.990">と</span><span begin="02:50.990" end="02:51.182">が</span><span begin="02:51.182" end="02:51.420">載</span><span begin="02:51.420" end="02:51.658">っ</span><span begin="02:51.658" end="02:51.896">て</span><span begin="02:51.896" end="02:52.415">な</span><span begin="02:52.415" end="02:52.934">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也不会记载什么重要信息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanjinna koto ga nottenai</span></p><p begin="02:56.260" end="02:58.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:56.260" end="02:56.456">最</span><span begin="02:56.456" end="02:56.652">近</span><span begin="02:56.652" end="02:56.848">調</span><span begin="02:56.848" end="02:57.045">子</span><span begin="02:57.045" end="02:57.294">ど</span><span begin="02:57.294" end="02:57.543">う</span><span begin="02:57.543" end="02:57.792">だ</span><span begin="02:57.792" end="02:58.041">い</span><span begin="02:58.041" end="02:58.290">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最近状况怎么样?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saikin  choushi doudai?</span></p><p begin="02:58.321" end="03:01.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:58.321" end="02:58.597">元</span><span begin="02:58.597" end="02:58.873">気</span><span begin="02:58.873" end="02:59.149">に</span><span begin="02:59.149" end="02:59.425">し</span><span begin="02:59.425" end="02:59.701">て</span><span begin="02:59.701" end="02:59.978">る</span><span begin="02:59.978" end="03:00.306">な</span><span begin="03:00.306" end="03:01.310">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">过得健康顺利的话就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">genki ni shiteru nara</span></p><p begin="03:02.749" end="03:04.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:02.749" end="03:02.981">別</span><span begin="03:02.981" end="03:03.213">に</span><span begin="03:03.213" end="03:03.445">い</span><span begin="03:03.445" end="03:03.679">い</span><span begin="03:03.679" end="03:04.145">け</span><span begin="03:04.145" end="03:04.610">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也没什么特别要紧的事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">betsuni ii kedo</span></p><p begin="03:04.641" end="03:12.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:04.641" end="03:05.230">僕</span><span begin="03:05.230" end="03:05.819">の</span><span begin="03:05.819" end="03:06.407">世</span><span begin="03:06.407" end="03:06.996">界</span><span begin="03:06.996" end="03:07.408">消</span><span begin="03:07.408" end="03:07.820">え</span><span begin="03:07.820" end="03:08.233">る</span><span begin="03:08.233" end="03:08.519">ま</span><span begin="03:08.519" end="03:09.569">で</span><span begin="03:10.529" end="03:10.823">会</span><span begin="03:10.823" end="03:11.117">え</span><span begin="03:11.117" end="03:11.411">ぬ</span><span begin="03:11.411" end="03:11.706">な</span><span begin="03:11.706" end="03:12.884">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果直到我的世界消失之前都无法见面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">boku no sekai kieru made aenu nara</span></p><p begin="03:12.914" end="03:21.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="03:12.914" end="03:13.581">君</span><span begin="03:13.581" end="03:14.249">の</span><span begin="03:14.249" end="03:14.911">側</span><span begin="03:14.911" end="03:15.574">で</span><span begin="03:15.574" end="03:16.032">眠</span><span begin="03:16.032" end="03:16.490">ら</span><span begin="03:16.490" end="03:16.949">せ</span><span begin="03:16.949" end="03:17.649">て </span><span begin="03:17.649" end="03:17.964">ど</span><span begin="03:17.964" end="03:18.279">ん</span><span begin="03:18.279" end="03:18.595">な</span><s